  "The last checks before the whole team starts, item by item, and what to do in the first weeks.": "Ukaguzi wa mwisho kabla ya timu nzima kuanza, kipengele kwa kipengele, na nini cha kufanya katika wiki za kwanza.",
  "Open the go-live checklist": "Fungua orodha ya ukaguzi kabla ya kuanza",
  "The checklist checks your company for you and links straight to anything that is missing. A ✓ means done, ! means to do, and • means it cannot be checked from inside the app and is done by whoever manages your hosting, following the go-live runbook.": "Orodha inakagua kampuni yako kwa niaba yako na inaunganisha moja kwa moja na chochote kinachokosekana. ✓ ni imekamilika, ! ni ya kufanya, na • ni kitu kisichoweza kukaguliwa ndani ya programu na kinafanywa na anayesimamia uhifadhi wa mtandao wako, akifuata mwongozo wa kuanza kutumia.",
  "Open More → Go-live checklist.": "Fungua Zaidi → Orodha ya ukaguzi kabla ya kuanza.",
  "Read the line at the top, for example 14 of 16 automatic checks done, and the progress bar.": "Soma mstari ulio juu, kwa mfano Ukaguzi wa kiotomatiki 14 kati ya 16 umekamilika, na upau wa maendeleo.",
  "Each group has its own count. Tap any line marked ! to open the screen where you fix it.": "Kila kundi lina hesabu yake. Gusa mstari wowote wenye alama ! kufungua skrini ya kuurekebisha.",
  "Go-live checklist": "Orodha ya ukaguzi kabla ya kuanza",
