  "Logo uploaded and colours set: the Logo card at the top of Company details.": "Nembo imepakiwa na rangi zimewekwa: kadi ya Nembo juu ya Maelezo ya kampuni.",
  "Bank details for quotations and invoices: under On your documents.": "Maelezo ya benki kwa nukuu za bei na ankara: chini ya Kwenye hati zako.",
  "Standard quotation and PO terms: both the quotation terms and the PO terms are written.": "Masharti ya kawaida ya nukuu ya bei na PO: masharti ya nukuu na masharti ya PO yote yameandikwa.",
  "TIN, VRN, address, phone and email filled in": "TIN, VRN, anwani, simu na barua pepe vimejazwa",
