  "This line needs a VRN. If you have none yet, leave it marked to do and go live anyway.": "Mstari huu unahitaji VRN. Kama bado huna, uache ukiwa wa kufanya na uanze kutumia hata hivyo.",
  "Tick it later by typing the VRN when TRA gives it to you.": "Uweke tiki baadaye kwa kuandika VRN TRA itakapokupa.",
  "Checklist: People": "Orodha: Watu",
  "Checks that you are not working alone and that strangers cannot create companies on your installation.": "Ukaguzi kuwa hufanyi kazi peke yako na kwamba wageni hawawezi kuunda kampuni kwenye usakinishaji wako.",
  "Team invited with the right roles: ticked once more than one role is in use. The detail shows the team, for example 2 management, 1 sales, 1 finance.": "Timu imealikwa kwa majukumu sahihi: inawekwa tiki zaidi ya jukumu moja likitumika. Maelezo yanaonyesha timu, kwa mfano uongozi 2, mauzo 1, fedha 1.",
  "Public sign-up of new companies switched off: done in the database by whoever manages your hosting (runbook step 5).": "Usajili wa wazi wa kampuni mpya umezimwa: unafanywa kwenye hifadhidata na anayesimamia uhifadhi wa mtandao wako (hatua ya 5 ya mwongozo).",
  "Team invited with the right roles": "Timu imealikwa kwa majukumu sahihi",
  "2 management, 1 sales, 1 procurement, 1 warehouse, 1 finance": "uongozi 2, mauzo 1, ununuzi 1, ghala 1, fedha 1",
  "Public sign-up of new companies switched off": "Usajili wa wazi wa kampuni mpya umezimwa",
  "To do": "Za kufanya",
  "Checklist: Your data": "Orodha: Data yako",
  "Checks that the records your team needs on day one are in place.": "Ukaguzi kuwa kumbukumbu ambazo timu yako inazihitaji siku ya kwanza zipo.",
  "Clients, suppliers and products loaded: at least one of each. The detail shows the counts.": "Wateja, wasambazaji na bidhaa zimepakiwa: angalau moja ya kila aina. Maelezo yanaonyesha idadi.",
  "Costs on most products (for margins and profit): at least 8 in 10 products have a last cost.": "Gharama kwenye bidhaa nyingi (kwa faida na mapato): angalau bidhaa 8 kati ya 10 zina gharama ya mwisho.",
  "Exchange rates for every foreign currency you use: every currency set on a client or supplier has a rate.": "Viwango vya ubadilishaji kwa kila sarafu ya kigeni unayotumia: kila sarafu iliyowekwa kwa mteja au msambazaji ina kiwango.",
  "Opening stock loaded: skip if you only buy to order.": "Stoku ya mwanzo imepakiwa: ruka kama unanunua kwa oda tu.",
  "Test transactions cleared: marked •, done in the database once testing is finished (runbook step 4).": "Miamala ya majaribio imefutwa: ina alama •, inafanywa kwenye hifadhidata majaribio yakishakamilika (hatua ya 4 ya mwongozo).",
  "Clients, suppliers and products loaded": "Wateja, wasambazaji na bidhaa zimepakiwa",
  "78 clients, 22 suppliers, 412 products": "Wateja 78, wasambazaji 22, bidhaa 412",
