  "Only 301 of 412 products have a cost, which is less than 8 in 10.": "Bidhaa 301 tu kati ya 412 zina gharama, ambayo ni chini ya 8 kati ya 10.",
  "Add the Last cost (TZS) column to your import file for the missing products and import it again.": "Ongeza safu ya Last cost (TZS) kwenye faili lako la kuingiza kwa bidhaa zinazokosa na uliingize tena.",
  "Or ask Grace in procurement to fill in the Last cost under Purchasing on each product.": "Au mwombe Grace wa ununuzi ajaze Gharama ya mwisho chini ya Ununuzi kwenye kila bidhaa.",
  "Exchange rates says missing: EUR": "Viwango vya ubadilishaji vinasema vinakosekana: EUR",
  "One supplier in Germany was imported with Currency EUR, but there is no EUR rate.": "Msambazaji mmoja wa Ujerumani aliingizwa na Sarafu EUR, lakini hakuna kiwango cha EUR.",
  "Open Finance → Exchange rates and add EUR with today's rate.": "Fungua Fedha → Viwango vya ubadilishaji na uongeze EUR kwa kiwango cha leo.",
  "Or, if that supplier really invoices in TZS, change the supplier's Currency to TZS.": "Au, kama msambazaji huyo kweli anatoa ankara kwa TZS, badilisha Sarafu ya msambazaji kuwa TZS.",
  "Checklist: Alerts and hosting": "Orodha: Tahadhari na uhifadhi wa mtandao",
  "The Alerts group mirrors the Alerts setup page. Hosting and safety checks your web address; its • lines are for whoever manages your hosting.": "Kundi la Tahadhari linafanana na ukurasa wa Mipangilio ya tahadhari. Uhifadhi na usalama inakagua anwani yako ya wavuti; mistari yake yenye • ni ya anayesimamia uhifadhi wa mtandao wako.",
  "Server key for alerts (OUTBOX_SECRET), Alert check running, Phone notifications (VAPID keys) and Alert emails (Resend + your domain): finish the three steps on Alerts setup.": "Ufunguo wa seva kwa tahadhari (OUTBOX_SECRET), Ukaguzi wa tahadhari unaendelea, Arifa za simu (funguo za VAPID) na Barua pepe za tahadhari (Resend + kikoa chako): kamilisha hatua tatu kwenye Mipangilio ya tahadhari.",
  "Your own web address: ticked when the app runs on your own domain, not a .netlify.app address.": "Anwani yako ya wavuti: inawekwa tiki programu ikiendeshwa kwenye kikoa chako mwenyewe, si anwani ya .netlify.app.",
  "NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL matches the web address: set in Netlify by whoever manages your hosting.": "NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL inalingana na anwani ya tovuti: inawekwa kwenye Netlify na anayesimamia uhifadhi wa mtandao wako.",
  "Supabase sign-in settings, the nightly encrypted database backup in GitHub and a private GitHub repository are marked • (runbook steps 2, 6 and 7).": "Mipangilio ya kuingia ya Supabase, nakala rudufu ya usiku iliyosimbwa ya hifadhidata kwenye GitHub na hazina ya GitHub ya faragha zina alama • (hatua 2, 6 na 7 za mwongozo).",
  "Your own web address": "Anwani yako ya wavuti",
  "now: app.kilisupplies.co.tz": "sasa: app.kilisupplies.co.tz",
  "NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL matches the web address": "NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL inalingana na anwani ya tovuti",
