  "Run one test order from start to finish": "Endesha oda moja ya majaribio mwanzo hadi mwisho",
  "Before real work, follow one order all the way through, so everyone sees their part and you check the PDFs.": "Kabla ya kazi halisi, fuatilia oda moja hadi mwisho, ili kila mtu aone sehemu yake na wewe ukague PDF.",
  "Juma makes a quotation for Kilimanjaro Hotels Ltd and presses Preview PDF. Check the logo, TIN, terms and bank details.": "Juma anatengeneza nukuu ya bei kwa Kilimanjaro Hotels Ltd na kubonyeza Hakiki PDF. Kagua nembo, TIN, masharti na maelezo ya benki.",
