  "If you use Integrations & API, tell your accountant they will get four CSV files at the start of each month.": "Kama unatumia Miunganisho na API, mwambie mhasibu wako atapata faili nne za CSV mwanzoni mwa kila mwezi.",
  "If the accountant's software reads data directly, create one API key for it on Integrations & API.": "Kama programu ya mhasibu inasoma data moja kwa moja, tengeneza ufunguo mmoja wa API kwa ajili yake kwenye Miunganisho na API.",
