  "As the business grows, LeMoSp suggests features or a new level, with the reason. You decide. Nothing is ever deleted when you change level.": "Biashara inapokua, LeMoSp inapendekeza vipengele au kiwango kipya, pamoja na sababu. Wewe ndiye unaamua. Hakuna kinachofutwa unapobadilisha kiwango.",
